Package: rhodep-usb-otg
Version: 4
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: rhodep port
Depends: i2c-tools
Description: USB-C charge/OTG control for Motorola rhodep (single port)
 Default = charging (device mode) at boot. OTG on demand with 'otg on'.
 In OTG (boost) the SGM41542 charger cannot sense an incoming charger
 (reg0x08 VBUS_STAT=OTG), so OTG->charge is not automatic: use 'otg off'.
 Commands: otg on (host+VBUS, for USB adapters) | otg off (charge) | otg status
